=== Dance troupe ===
[[Kamri Peterson]], a former pro on ''[[Dancing with the Stars: Juniors]]'', was announced as a first-time troupe member on August 2, 2026, during the series' inaugural [[Dancing with the Stars (American TV series)#Fan convention|fan convention]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Garner |first=Glenn |last2=Tapp |first2=Tom |date=August 2, 2026 |title=''Dancing with the Stars'': ''DWTS: Juniors'' Alum Kamri Peterson Joins The Season 35 Troupe |url=https://deadline.com/2026/08/dancing-with-the-stars-kamri-peterson-pro-1237015588/ |url-status=live |access-date=August 3, 2026 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260802234650/https://deadline.com/2026/08/dancing-with-the-stars-kamri-peterson-pro-1237015588/|archive-date=August 2, 2026}}</ref> Jaxon Willard, Carter Williams, and Onye Stevenson were announced as second-year troupe members on September 4.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Siwak |first=Miranda |date=September 5, 2026 |title=''Dancing With the Stars'' Season 35 Troupe Revealed: Who Is Returning to the Ballroom? |url=https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-troupe-revealed-for-season-35/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260905151706/https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-troupe-revealed-for-season-35/ |archive-date=September 5, 2026 |access-date=September 5, 2026 |website=[[Us Weekly]] |language=en-US}}</ref>

